# Agent Harness Runtime
# .harness/tasks/   — task files, local, ignored
# .harness/reports/ — team reports, local experiment output, ignored
# .harness/runs/    — per-run logs/evidence, local experiment output, ignored
# .harness/sessions/ — session ids, local + persistent, ignored
# .harness/timeline.md — append-only run log, local/experimental, ignored
# Folders themselves stay tracked via .gitkeep below.
.harness/tasks/*
.harness/reports/*
.harness/runs/*
.harness/sessions/*
.harness/timeline.md
!.harness/tasks/.gitkeep
!.harness/reports/.gitkeep
!.harness/runs/.gitkeep
!.harness/sessions/.gitkeep

